OK      Scenario 2: turn 90 deg left   -> RobotCommand(kind=turn, distance_m=0.000, yaw_rad=1.5708)
OK      turn right 45 deg              -> RobotCommand(kind=turn, distance_m=0.000, yaw_rad=-0.7854)
OK      move forward 10 m              -> RobotCommand(kind=move, distance_m=10.000, yaw_rad=0.0000)
OK      move back 3 feet               -> RobotCommand(kind=move, distance_m=-0.914, yaw_rad=0.0000)
OK      stop                           -> RobotCommand(kind=stop, distance_m=0.000, yaw_rad=0.0000)
OK      LLM chatter + code fence       -> RobotCommand(kind=move, distance_m=2.000, yaw_rad=0.0000)
REJECT  truncated JSON                 -> no JSON object found in LLM output
REJECT  out of bounds (500 m)          -> |distance| 500.00 m exceeds limit 20.0 m
REJECT  missing unit                   -> unknown/missing distance unit: None
REJECT  turn without direction         -> turn needs direction left/right, got None
REJECT  unsupported command            -> command not supported by this robot
REJECT  unknown action                 -> malformed intent: Input should be 'move', 'turn', 'stop' or 'unsupported'
